            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/WBUVED+Georgia-Bold",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "To the Board of Directors and Shareholders of HON INDUSTRIES Inc. "
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          506.8747272376544,
          988.9315708700765,
          11.25132060185183,
          8.844163991769545
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "59"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
          227.42102233980017,
          800.0569641203704,
          10.885174603174619
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "The following report is a copy of a report previously issued by Arthur Andersen LLP and has not been reissued by Arthur Andersen LLP. In 2002, "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
          246.70379717813057,
          800.2343302469135,
          10.885174603174619
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "the corporation adopted the provisions of Statement of Financial Accounting Standards No. 142, Goodwill and Other Intangible Assets (SFAS "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
          265.98657201646097,
          800.0313865740741,
          10.885174603174619
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "No. 142). As discussed in the Goodwill and Intangible Assets note, the Company has presented the transitional disclosures for 2001 required by "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
          285.26934685479137,
          800.0824625771604,
          10.885174603174619
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "SFAS No. 142. The Arthur Andersen LLP report does not extend to these changes to the 2001 consolidated financial statements. The adjustments "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
          304.55212169312176,
          765.3210111882717,
          10.885174603174619
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "to the 2001 consolidated financial statements were reported on by PricewaterhouseCoopers LLP as stated in their report appearing herein. "
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
          352.75905878894764,
          799.9298198302469,
          10.885174603174733
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "We have audited the accompanying consolidated balance sheets of HON INDUSTRIES Inc. and Subsidiaries as of December 29, 2001, "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
          372.04183362727804,
          800.0319718364196,
          10.885174603174733
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "December 30, 2000*, and January 1, 2000*, and the related consolidated statements of income, shareholders equity, and cash flows for each of "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
          391.32460846560843,
          799.9556030092592,
          10.885174603174733
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "the fiscal years then ended. These financial statements are the responsibility of the Company’s management. Our responsibility is to express an "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
          410.6074194591416,
          323.9633823302469,
          10.885102292769034
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "opinion on these financial statements based on our audits. "
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          170.83333333333334,
          429.890194297472,
          743.1254587191358,
          10.885102292769034
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "We conducted our audits in accordance with auditing standards generally accepted in the United States. Those standards require that "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
          449.1729691358024,
          800.0948163580248,
          10.885102292769034
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "we plan and perform the audit to obtain reasonable assurance about whether the financial statements are free of material misstatement. An audit "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
          468.4557439741328,
          800.0317662037036,
          10.885102292769034
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "includes examining, on a test basis, evidence supporting the amounts and disclosures in the financial statements. An audit also includes assessing "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
          487.7385188124632,
          800.045005787037,
          10.885102292769034
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "the accounting principles used and significant estimates made by management, as well as evaluating the overall financial statement presentation. "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
          507.0212936507936,
          385.6658040123457,
          10.885102292769034
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "We believe that our audits provide a reasonable basis for our opinion. "
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          170.83333333333334,
          526.3040684891241,
          743.2269305555554,
          10.885102292768977
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "In our opinion, the consolidated financial statements referred to above present fairly, in all material respects, the financial position of "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
          545.5868433274544,
          800.2342195216049,
          10.885102292769034
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "HON INDUSTRIES Inc. and Subsidiaries as of December 29, 2001, December 30, 2000*, and January 1, 2000*, and the results of its operations "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
          564.8696181657848,
          789.2372982253086,
          10.885102292769034
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "and its cash flows for each of the three fiscal years then ended in conformity with accounting principles generally accepted in the United States. "
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
          656.4627986478542,
          122.39257677469138,
          10.885102292768977
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/YROHGZ+Georgia",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Arthur Andersen LLP "
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          113.88888888888889,
          675.7455734861846,
          89.39009182098766,
          10.885102292768977
        ],
